{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29178","headline":"中秋夕寄大梁刘尚书 · 许浑","name":"中秋夕寄大梁刘尚书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汴人迎拜洛人留，虎豹旌旗拥碧油。\n[刁]斗严更军耳目，戈鋋长控国咽喉。\n柳营出号风生纛，莲幕题诗月上楼。\n应念散郎千里外，去年今夜醉兰舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}